   "text": "Revision C of the response code starts at midnight on Monday 19 October, depot local. The dispatch instant on the page decides which revision covers a call.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1760900000.000100",
   "user_id": "U0CRNMGR"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C0CRNNOTICE",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Clocks go back in the early hours of Sunday 25 October. Key the desk as you find it and let the paging archive carry the true instants.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1761300000.000100",
   "user_id": "U0CRNCTL"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C0CRNDESK",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Reminder for standby crews: a job sheet countersigned at hand-back beats the paging clear line, which only tells us when the session dropped.",
